# Build context for the Glama introspection image (`Dockerfile`).
#
# The Python half of this image is installed from PyPI, not from this directory,
# so the context only has to carry the launcher itself: `bin/laya-mcp.js`,
# `lib.js` and `package.json`. Everything listed here is weight the image never
# looks at.

# Version control and CI
.git
.github

# Nothing is installed from npm (no runtime dependencies), so a checked-out or
# freshly installed tree is never part of the image.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Python bytecode caches, in case anything here was ever imported
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# The launcher's own tests; the image runs the launcher, not its suite.
test/

# Documentation. Unlike a Python source install there is no metadata here that
# reads a README, so this cannot break the build.
*.md

.DS_Store
